    "detailed_description": "Eden Universe Is a simulation-strategy game from &quot;god game&quot; genre asking one simple question.<br><br><strong>Did You ever wonder how it is like to be a God</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/55ca249097c8bd634d4529f13766b6c7.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/55ca249097c8bd634d4529f13766b6c7.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/55ca249097c8bd634d4529f13766b6c7.mp4?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Player become a God which goal is to develop his cult. <br>The world of Eden is inhabited by a variety of civilizations which are waiting for your revelation.<br>Be wary because you're not the only one which will try to conquer the hearts of new devotes. As a higher being, you can be Good as well as Evil. In Your decision, you will be aided by your conscience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/30e2979f3f8835bf54baecbefce2f3f4.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/30e2979f3f8835bf54baecbefce2f3f4.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>The player holds a wide array of possibilities in his hands. In addition to standard solutions known from strategy games like gathering resources by villagers. Eden also offer additional interactions with environment with help of your divine hand.<br>You're the one deciding if you want to take care of your subjects and help mortals with their trivial tasks, because you can directly deliver resources to your storage, picking up trees, stones and way more. Experiment with possibilities and learn how to get most out of your divine interference mechanic to tip the scale of victory to your side.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/38ccebca56e805f8df73067c21b26b66.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/38ccebca56e805f8df73067c21b26b66.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/38d09024600a48d4b60e3c9ab9030d75.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/38d09024600a48d4b60e3c9ab9030d75.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/4794a8b6d1881a3d0ffb5d3bf3045961.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/4794a8b6d1881a3d0ffb5d3bf3045961.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/c1c09a6a43da790cc15d8e172322ad21.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/c1c09a6a43da790cc15d8e1