https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/7a01a81ca813b70fa595f67e53658d8f.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/276cf57c48ac2d57b294081d1ef507a8.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/276cf57c48ac2d57b294081d1ef507a8.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/3e42b627b3714ac3a45694d80a55cad8.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/3e42b627b3714ac3a45694d80a55cad8.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/a5e19426c83391f78bea6f75b333c154.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/a5e19426c83391f78bea6f75b333c154.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/a5e19426c83391f78bea6f75b333c154.mp4?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In addition to Divine powers, the player will have access to a divine creature called &quot;Avatar&quot;, which mission is to help his master in his divine quest. You and your avatar are like &quot;Yin &amp; Yang&quot;, unseparable. All Divine pets have their own specific array of skills and dominant traits. They can mimic actions of player and enemies alike, and also other Avatars. There is also a possibility to teach him how to use Divine powers same as player.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/62fd22e57e4deeed1ef05f716d7e34f4.poster.avif?t=1722943497\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/62fd22e57e4deeed1ef05f716d7e34f4.webm?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/62fd22e57e4deeed1ef05f716d7e34f4.mp4?t=1722943497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game beside its simplicity offers interesting and deep story which is crucial part of the gameplay. There will be time for serious decisions, but also moments for all the reference and jokes. All mission of the campaign are divided in Main, Side and Tutorial quests. Fans of puzzles will also find something for themselves because Eden is not typical strategy game and inhabitants of this world offer plethora of challenges for which awaits you great rewards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/7ee9ab34d5e2d19c84ce333d260f5c37.avif?t=1722943497\" /></div>    <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/72e47b0aa0438a12904cc5f9f58eb775.avif?t=1722943497\" /></div><br><br>In our Decisions we will be aided by our advisors - Good and Evil conscience. <br>Both characters will be charming in their own way. They will guide player in to the ways of Good and Evil God",
